  "description": "Set sail on a ruthless rogue-like pirate adventure where every voyage brings you closer to glory—or to the bottom of the sea. Long ago, you made a cursed deal with the legendary Davey Jones, and now he’s coming to claim your soul. With the clock ticking toward your final confrontation, you must raid ships, hunt treasure, build your crew, and become powerful enough to survive the battle waiting beyond the horizon.\n\nCommand your own pirate ship across a constantly changing ocean filled with enemy vessels, hidden treasure, mysterious encounters, and dangerous opportunities. Raid ships for resources, follow risky treasure maps, and make difficult choices that shape every voyage. No two runs are the same, with randomized events and encounters creating a fresh adventure every time you play.\n\nKey Features\n• Rogue-Like Pirate Runs: Every voyage is unique with random encounters and shifting challenges\n• Ship Progression: Upgrade weapons, abilities, and crew to grow stronger over time\n• Ocean Exploration: Sail through dangerous seas filled with treasure, enemies, and secrets\n• Strategic Decisions: Every choice shapes your path, power, and survival chances\n• Naval Combat: Fast, stylized ship battles inspired by pirate legends\n• Time Pressure: Race against the clock as Davey Jones closes in on your soul\n\nRaise the sails, gather your crew, and fight for your freedom before the sea claims you forever.",
